## 🖥️ **MULTI-IDE SUPPORT**

| IDE | Commands/Workflows | Ignore File | Rules Folder |
|-----|-------------------|-------------|--------------|
| **Cursor** | `.cursor/commands/` | `.cursorignore` | `.cursor/rules/` |
| **Windsurf** | `.windsurf/workflows/` | `.windsurfignore` | `.windsurf/rules/` |

