## � **AGENT ENABLE/DISABLE PROTOCOL**

### **Enable Pattern**

```
# In .cursorignore OR .windsurfignore:
# /r-genie/01_Technical_Design_Agent/    ← ENABLED (commented = AI can read)
/r-genie/01_Technical_Design_Agent/      ← DISABLED (uncommented = AI ignores)
```

### **Enable/Disable Per Stage**

| Stage | Enable This Agent | Disable Previous |
|-------|-------------------|-----------------|
| 1 | `01_Technical_Design_Agent` | (none — first stage) |
| 2 | `02_API_Specification_Agent` | `01_Technical_Design_Agent` |
| 3 | `03_App_Development_Agent` | `02_API_Specification_Agent` |
| 4 | `03-01_Dataweave_Agent` | `03_App_Development_Agent` |
| 5 | `04_Munit_Agent` | `03-01_Dataweave_Agent` |
| 6 | `05_ReadMe_Agent` | `04_Munit_Agent` |
| 7 | `06_Code_Review_Agent` | `05_ReadMe_Agent` |

> ⚠️ Update BOTH ignore files if project is used in both Cursor and Windsurf.

