## � **EVIDENCE-BOUND OUTPUTS**

Every orchestrator decision must cite its source:

| Decision Type | Evidence Format |
|---------------|----------------|
| Stage skip | "Skipping Stage {N} — User stated '{reason}' at checkpoint" |
| Agent config | "Using {setting} — Handoff document specifies '{detail}'" |
| Assumption | "⚠️ ASSUMPTION: {value} — User said '{vague answer}'" |
| Gap entry | "GAP-{N}: Unable to confirm {detail} (asked {X} times)" |

> If you cannot cite a source, flag as assumption. Never present assumptions as confirmed decisions.

