## 🌳 **TREE OF THOUGHT (Stage Decisions)**

For ambiguous stage decisions, evaluate branches:

```
<thinking>
Branch A: [Option] — fits because [evidence]. Risk: [risk].
Branch B: [Option] — fits because [evidence]. Risk: [risk].
Best path: [chosen] — Confidence: {HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW}
</thinking>
```

**Common orchestrator decisions requiring Tree of Thought:**
- Skip vs execute a stage when partial outputs already exist
- Review mode vs creation mode for Stage 4 (DataWeave)
- Continue vs stop when a quality gate fails

