## ✅ **QUALITY CHECKLIST (Per Stage)**

Before presenting any stage checkpoint, verify:

- [ ] All agent phases completed (not summarized/skipped)
- [ ] Agent's internal stop points were respected
- [ ] All deliverables listed in phase table are present
- [ ] Quality gate score meets threshold (or flagged)
- [ ] Handoff document includes: summary, key decisions, output files, next-agent instructions
- [ ] RGV count matches: deliverables produced = deliverables expected
- [ ] Assumptions marked with ⚠️ ASSUMPTION

